&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of distributed architecture including application, database and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with on-prem systems and/or major public/private cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience in Linux, networking, security, containerization (Docker/Kubernetes), and infrastructure automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming/Scripting:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience utilizing programming or scripting languages in a corporate environment (e.g., Python, Javascript, Go).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional customer advocacy, relationship-building, and soft skills including whiteboarding and driving architectural conversations. Proven ability to lead and articulate technical solutions to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to an open-source project or documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
