&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;20&quot;&gt;What Is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses, people, and government agencies. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500 and across major federal departments, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting critical information — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for Search, Security, and Observability help public sector organizations deliver on the promise of AI and Zero Trust modernization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is seeking a dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Federal Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;. As an integral part of our growth strategy, you will play a key role in growing our presence within the &lt;strong&gt;United States Department of Treasury&lt;/strong&gt; (USDT) customer accounts. This is an opportunity for those who are passionate about empowering Public Sector organizations through ground breaking AI powered search technology and analytics, enabling them to unlock the full potential of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining our GEO of the Year winning team, Elastic is seeking a dynamic Federal Account Executive to lead and scale our footprint within the United States Department of the Treasury (USDT) and its key sub-agencies, with a heavy emphasis on the Internal Revenue Service (IRS), Office of the Comptroller of the Currency (OCC), Bureau of the Fiscal Service, and the U.S. Mint.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an extraordinary opportunity for a quota-crushing federal seller to drive massive adoption of AI-powered search, log analytics, SIEM, and observability across critical government mission sets. You will lead high-visibility pursuits to modernize legacy IT and security footprints, help agencies comply with federal logging and security mandates (such as OMB M-21-31), and displace expensive, legacy SIEM and monitoring vendors across the Treasury ecosystem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Strategic Adoption: Expand the adoption of Elastic’s Search AI, Security, and Observability solutions within the Department of the Treasury, IRS, and associated financial regulatory bureaus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capitalize on Competitive Displacements: Execute land-and-expand strategies to replace legacy SIEM and monitoring providers (e.g., Splunk), helping agencies lower total cost of ownership (TCO) while meeting critical federal security and logging mandates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a Trusted Advisor: Work closely with agency leaders, enterprise architects, and CISO/CIO teams to solve complex mission challenges through AI-powered search, log analytics, APM, and threat hunting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute Complex FedCiv Sales Cycles: Proactively identify new programs, navigate federal procurement pathways (GSA, NASA SEWP, agency-specific IDIQs), and manage matrixed sales pursuits from lead to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the Elastic Model: Articulate the immense value of our commercial features and cloud offerings while leveraging our open-source roots and vibrant community ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Ecosystem Coalitions: Develop comprehensive territory plans utilizing systems integrators, VARs, cloud partners (AWS, Azure, GCP), and federal channel programs to accelerate deal velocity and account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Track Record: Demonstrated history of quota overachievement and multi-million-dollar deal execution selling enterprise SaaS/cloud software into Federal Civilian (FedCiv) agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Treasury &amp;amp; IRS Knowledge: Direct experience selling into The Department of the Treasury and/or the Internal Revenue Service (IRS), with established relationships among agency buyers and key system integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain Expertise: Strong understanding of Enterprise Search, Log Analytics, Security/SIEM, APM, Observability, and Cloud architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value-Based Seller: Adept at navigating both technical teams (developers, SOC analysts) and executive decision-makers (CXOs, Program Managers, Procurement).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting Discipline: Consistent history of accurate pipeline management and sales forecasting using Salesforce (SFDC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Source Appreciation: Enthusiasm for the open-source software model and the community that relies on our technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent Career Growth demonstrating a strong track record of career stability, meaningful tenure, and sustained progression within organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling against legacy SIEM providers (e.g., Splunk, QRadar) or monitoring solutions in federal environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of federal security frameworks, OMB mandates (M-21-31, Zero Trust), and FedRAMP cloud deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network within Treasury&#39;s prime contractor ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are eager to run with the top Public Sector team in the business, displace legacy tech, and solve mission-critical federal problems through Search AI—we want to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary plus a variable component, that together comprise the On-Target Earnings (OTE).&amp;nbsp; On-Target Earnings (OTE) are based on a 50/50 pay mix (base salary / target variable).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
