&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;2kdet-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2kdet-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Lead Data Engineer to join our Data Engineering &amp;amp; Architecture team. In this role, you&#39;ll help grow a Data Platform that makes it easier for teams across our company to work with data confidently and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rs:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2kdet-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;effectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2kdet-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;. Your work will directly support our business goals not just by keeping data flowing, but by turning it into something people can actually use and trust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;fbl08&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6gsbv-0-0&quot;&gt;
