&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;u12g-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;fbl08&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;fkbov-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;fkbov-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;fkbov-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll design, maintain, and improve the pipelines and infrastructure that power our data platform. Day to day, that means working across the full data lifecycle — from ingestion and streaming to transformation and delivery — using tools like Apache Airflow, Spark, Iceberg, Kafka, Flink, and dbt Labs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;fbl08&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;717ud-0-0&quot;&gt;
