&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a1sie-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a1sie-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design user-focused flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a1sie-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Create organized onboarding experiences. These should highlight best practices, troubleshooting, and clear next steps. Avoid confusing &#39;choose-your-own-adventure&#39; methods.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
