&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a dynamic Revenue Manager who is eager to collaborate and support significant growth at a global, publicly traded software company! Based in the US, this position will report directly to the Sr. Manager, Revenue Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you well-versed in revenue accounting? Does being a critical member of a cross-functional team that is continuously problem-solving sound exhilarating and ambitious? Do you want to be a key contributor in a fast-paced, rapidly growing technology company?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If so, we would love to hear from you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a key contributor to the ownership of Elastic Cloud Revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing or reviewing revenue reconciliations and analysis, and managing complex, large datasets in support of the Revenue close process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting across all Elastic revenue contract reviews under ASC 606 guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determining appropriate revenue recognition for signed contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading and reviewing UAT testing to drive Cloud Revenue system and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating and managing auditing requests, including addressing auditor inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing technical accounting positions and drafting memos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating revenue policies for scalability while maintaining consistency with ASC 606.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and executing on opportunities to improve existing processes and controls and minimize risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and delivering internal training to enhance organizational revenue knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting cross-functional partners (Deal Desk, Order Ops, Billing/AR/Collections, FP&amp;amp;A, IT/Engineering).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A detailed understanding of ASC 606, including SaaS-related principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A general understanding of the Order-to-Cash process and the impact each step of the process can have on revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of AI and the impact it can make on a daily basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortability working independently in a distributed, dynamic, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate independently, manage competing priorities with composure in a fast-paced environment, and collaborate effectively with strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Composure in evolving in ambitious circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to project manage and balance multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive and proactive demeanor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong desire for learning, growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to consumption-based revenue accounting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Big 4 and/or publicly traded technology company experience (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RevPro and NetSuite (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPA or progress towards CPA certification (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Workspace and Gemini across Workspace (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Cloud Revenue from Marketplaces (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated Business Intelligence (BI) reporting (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
