&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3iqjd-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3iqjd-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3iqjd-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The Streams Backend team is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r10:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3iqjd-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3iqjd-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; the backend services powering this pipeline, ensuring data is routed, processed, and delivered efficiently and reliably at scale. We also own Logstash, the open-source streaming ETL tool (and the “L” in the “ELK stack”) trusted by enterprises worldwide to move and transform data, and we are regular contributors to the OpenTelemetry Collector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
