&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;d5tdk-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;d5tdk-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Knowledge of stream processing platforms (such as Kafka), database technologies (e.g., Postgres or MySQL) and network technologies (e.g., TCP, UDP and HTTP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
