an&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r20:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ej2vb-7-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ej2vb-8-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, as a team. We listen. We solve. We guide. We get it. And we’re excited to bring on a new team member to love.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
