&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPQ certification deemed relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years with business systems analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years with CPQ tools and functionalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years with Salesforce platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in gathering and documenting requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Configure, Price, Quote (CPQ) software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Salesforce CPQ functionalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with business process modeling tools&lt;/li&gt;
